      \uD604\uC7AC \uC794\uC561\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\\n3.
      \uCD9C\uAE08 \uC808\uCC28 \uBC0F \uC815\uBCF4 \uC815\uD655\uC131\\n\uCD9C\uAE08\uC744
      \uC694\uCCAD\uD560 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uC218\uB839 \uACC4\uC88C \uC815\uBCF4\uB97C
      \uC81C\uACF5\uD558\uACE0 \uC548\uB0B4\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C\u64CD\u4F5C\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
      \uCD9C\uAE08 \uC694\uCCAD\uC740 \uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC73C\uB85C 7\uC601\uC5C5\uC77C
      \uC774\uB0B4\uC5D0 \uCC98\uB9AC\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC790\uAE08\uC774 \uC9C0\uC815\uB41C
      \uACC4\uC88C\uC5D0 \uC774\uCCB4\uB41C \uD6C4, \uACC4\uC88C \uC815\uBCF4 \uC624\uB958
      \uB610\uB294 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC790\uC758\u64CD\u4F5C \uC2E4\uC218\uB85C \uC778\uD574
      \uC785\uAE08\uC5D0 \uC2E4\uD328\uD55C \uACBD\uC6B0 \uC7AC\uC774\uCCB4 \uB610\uB294
      \uC790\uAE08 \uD68C\uC218\uAC00 \uBD88\uAC00\uB2A5\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC81C\uACF5\uD558\uB294
      \uC815\uBCF4\uC758 \uC815\uD655\uC131\uC740 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC790\uC758 \uCC45\uC784\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.\\n4.
      \uBCF4\uC0C1 \uC9C0\uAE09, \uC138\uAE08 \uBC0F \uC774\uCCB4 \uC218\uC218\uB8CC\\n\uC790\uACA9\uC744
      \uAC16\uCD98 \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uD604\uAE08 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC740 \uAC8C\uC784\uC5D0\uC11C
      \uC9C0\uC815\uD55C \uBC29\uC2DD\uC73C\uB85C \uC9C0\uAE09\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uBCF4\uC0C1 \uC9C0\uAE09\uC740 \uC774\uCCB4 \uC11C\uBE44\uC2A4 \uC81C\uACF5\uC790\uC758
      \uC774\uC6A9 \uC57D\uAD00 \uBC0F \uAC1C\uC778\uC815\uBCF4 \uCC98\uB9AC\uBC29\uCE68\uC5D0
      \uB530\uB77C \uADDC\uC81C\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC801\uC6A9\uB418\uB294 \uBAA8\uB4E0
      \uC138\uAE08 \uBC0F \uC774\uCCB4 \uC218\uC218\uB8CC\uB294 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC790\uAC00
      \uBD80\uB2F4\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBC95\uB960\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uC694\uAD6C\uB418\uB294
      \uACBD\uC6B0, \uC9C0\uAE09 \uAE08\uC561\uC5D0\uC11C \uD574\uB2F9 \uAE08\uC561\uC744
      \uACF5\uC81C\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\\n5. \uBCF4\uC0C1 \uAD50\uD658
      \uC2E4\uD328\\n\uB2F9\uCCA8\uC790\uAC00 \uC9C0\uC815\uB41C \uAE30\uAC04 \uB0B4\uC5D0
      \uCD9C\uAE08\uC744 \uC694\uCCAD\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uAC70\uB098 \uACC4\uC815
      \uC0AD\uC81C \uB4F1\uC758 \uC774\uC720\uB85C \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744\u9886\u53D6\uD560
      \uC218 \uC5C6\uB294 \uACBD\uC6B0, \uC800\uD76C\uB294 \uD574\uB2F9 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744
      \uCDE8\uC18C\uD560 \uAD8C\uB9AC\uB97C \uBCF4\uC720\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBCF4\uC0C1
      \uC9C0\uAE09 \uB610\uB294 \uCDE8\uC18C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD55C \uACB0\uC815\uC740
      \uC800\uD76C\uC758 \uB2E8\uB3C5 \uD310\uB2E8\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uC774\uB8E8\uC5B4\uC9D1\uB2C8\uB2E4.\\n6.
      \uC801\uC6A9 \uC57D\uAD00 \uBC0F \uC704\uBC18 \uCC98\uB9AC\\n\uBCF8 \uC815\uCC45
      \uC120\uC5B8\uC740 \uAC8C\uC784\uC758 \uC774\uC6A9 \uC57D\uAD00 \uBC0F \uAC1C\uC778\uC815\uBCF4
      \uCC98\uB9AC\uBC29\uCE68\uC5D0 \uB530\uB77C \uC801\uC6A9\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uAD00\uB828 \uC57D\uAD00\uC744 \uC704\uBC18\uD560 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uBCF4\uC0C1
      \uCDE8\uC18C \uB610\uB294 \uACC4\uC815 \uC77C\uC2DC \uC911\uC9C0\uC758 \uC6D0\uC778\uC774
      \uB420 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n       
      \"es-ES\",\r\n        \"Declaraci\xF3n de Pol\xEDtica del Juego\\n1. Requisitos
      y Gesti\xF3n de la Cuenta\\nPara reclamar y gestionar recompensas, debes tener
      una cuenta v\xE1lida. Si no est\xE1s registrado, puedes inscribirte gratuitamente
      en el sitio web oficial. Aviso: si eliminas el juego del dispositivo, el saldo
      de tu cuenta se restablecer\xE1 a cero y todas las recompensas sin solicitar
      un retiro v\xE1lido ser\xE1n canceladas permanentemente.\\n2. Adquisici\xF3n
      de Recompensas y Consulta de Saldo\\nCuando ganas monedas en el juego, las
      recompensas se acreditan autom\xE1ticamente en tu saldo dentro del juego. Puedes
      consultar el saldo actual en cualquier momento en la p\xE1gina de inicio.\\n3.
      Proceso de Retiro y Precisi\xF3n de la Informaci\xF3n\\nAl solicitar un retiro,
      proporciona los datos de tu cuenta de recepci\xF3n y sigue las instrucciones.
      Las solicitudes de retiro suelen procesarse en un plazo de 7 d\xEDas h\xE1biles.
      Una vez que los fondos se hayan transferido a la cuenta designada, no podremos
      retransferirlos ni recuperarlos si el pago falla debido a errores en la informaci\xF3n
      de la cuenta o errores de\u64CD\u4F5C del usuario. Eres responsable de garantizar
      la precisi\xF3n de la informaci\xF3n proporcionada.\\n4. Pago de Recompensas,
      Impuestos y Tarifas de Transferencia\\nTodas las recompensas en efectivo elegibles
      se pagar\xE1n a trav\xE9s del m\xE9todo designado por el juego. El pago de
      las recompensas est\xE1 sujeto a los t\xE9rminos de uso y la pol\xEDtica de
      privacidad del proveedor del servicio de transferencia. Eres responsable de
      todos los impuestos aplicables y las tarifas de transferencia. Si la ley lo
      exige, podemos deducir el importe correspondiente de tu pago.\\n5. Fracaso
      en la Canje de Recompensas\\nSi el ganador no solicita el retiro dentro del
      plazo establecido o no puede reclamar la recompensa debido a la eliminaci\xF3n
      de la cuenta u otros motivos, nos reservamos el derecho de cancelar dicha recompensa.
      La decisi\xF3n sobre el pago o la cancelaci\xF3n de la recompensa corresponde
      exclusivamente a nosotros.\\n6. T\xE9rminos Aplicables y Tratamiento de Violaciones\\nLa
      presente declaraci\xF3n de pol\xEDtica se rige por los T\xE9rminos de Uso y
      la Pol\xEDtica de Privacidad del juego. La violaci\xF3n de estos t\xE9rminos
      puede dar lugar a la cancelaci\xF3n de recompensas o la suspensi\xF3n de la
      cuenta.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"es-MX\",\r\n        \"Declaraci\xF3n
      de Pol\xEDtica del Juego\\n1. Requisitos y Gesti\xF3n de la Cuenta\\nPara reclamar
      y gestionar recompensas, necesitas tener una cuenta v\xE1lida. Si no est\xE1s
      registrado, puedes inscribirte gratuitamente en el sitio web oficial. Aviso:
      si eliminas el juego del dispositivo, el saldo de tu cuenta se borrar\xE1 y
      todas las recompensas sin un retiro v\xE1lido solicitado ser\xE1n canceladas
      para siempre.\\n2. Adquisici\xF3n de Recompensas y Consulta de Saldo\\nCuando
      ganas monedas en el juego, las recompensas se a\xF1aden autom\xE1ticamente
      a tu saldo en el juego. Puedes ver el saldo actual en cualquier momento en
      la p\xE1gina de inicio.\\n3. Proceso de Retiro y Precisi\xF3n de la Informaci\xF3n\\nAl
      solicitar el retiro, proporciona los datos de tu cuenta de recebimiento y sigue
      las instrucciones. Las solicitudes de retiro generalmente se procesan en 7
      d\xEDas h\xE1biles. Despu\xE9s de que los fondos se transfieran a la cuenta
      designada, no podemos retransferirlos ni recuperarlos si el pago falla por
      errores en la informaci\xF3n de la cuenta o errores de\u64CD\u4F5C del usuario.
      Eres responsable de asegurar que la informaci\xF3n proporcionada sea precisa.\\n4.
      Pago de Recompensas, Impuestos y Tarifas de Transferencia\\nTodas las recompensas
      en efectivo elegibles se pagar\xE1n por el m\xE9todo que indique el juego.
      El pago de las recompensas est\xE1 sujeto a los t\xE9rminos de uso y la pol\xEDtica
      de privacidad del proveedor de transferencias. Eres responsable de todos los
      impuestos aplicables y las tarifas de transferencia. Si la ley lo requiere,
      podemos deducir el monto correspondiente de tu pago.\\n5. Fracaso en el Canje
      de Recompensas\\nSi el ganador no solicita el retiro dentro del plazo establecido
      o no puede reclamar la recompensa por eliminaci\xF3n de la cuenta u otros motivos,
      nos reservamos el derecho de cancelar esa recompensa. La decisi\xF3n de pagar
      o cancelar la recompensa es nuestra exclusiva.\\n6. T\xE9rminos Aplicables
      y Tratamiento de Violaciones\\nEsta declaraci\xF3n de pol\xEDtica se rige por
      los T\xE9rminos de Uso y la Pol\xEDtica de Privacidad del juego. Si violas
      estos t\xE9rminos, podr\xEDas perder las recompensas o tener la cuenta suspendida.\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"tr-TR\",\r\n        \"Oyun Politikas\u0131 Bildirimi\\n1.
      Hesap Gereksinimleri ve Y\xF6netimi\\n\xD6d\xFCller almak ve y\xF6netmek i\xE7in
      ge\xE7erli bir hesaba sahip olman\u0131z gerekir. Hen\xFCz kay\u0131t olmad\u0131ysan\u0131z,
      resmi web sitesinden \xFCcretsiz olarak kay\u0131t olabilirsiniz. Uyar\u0131:
      cihaz\u0131n\u0131zdan oyunu silerseniz, hesap bakiyeniz s\u0131f\u0131rlanacak
      ve ge\xE7erli bir \xE7ekme iste\u011Fi g\xF6ndermemi\u015F t\xFCm \xF6d\xFCller
      kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak iptal edilecek.\\n2. \xD6d\xFCl Alma ve Bakiye Sorgulama\\nOyunda
      para birimi kazand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131zda, \xF6d\xFCller otomatik olarak
      oyun i\xE7i bakiyenize eklenecektir. Anytime ana sayfadan mevcut bakiyenizi
      kontrol edebilirsiniz.\\n3. \xC7ekme S\xFCreci ve Bilgi Do\u011Frulu\u011Fu\\n\xC7ekme
      iste\u011Fi g\xF6nderirken, al\u0131c\u0131 hesap bilgilerinizi sa\u011Flay\u0131n
      ve talimatlar\u0131 izleyin. \xC7ekme istekleri genellikle 7 i\u015F g\xFCn\xFC
      i\xE7inde i\u015Flenir. Fonlar belirtilen hesaba transfer edildikten sonra,
      hesap bilgilerindeki hatalar veya kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n\u64CD\u4F5C hatalar\u0131
      nedeniyle \xF6deme ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z olursa, tekrar g\xF6nderme veya
      fonlar\u0131 geri alma m\xFCmk\xFCn olmayacakt\u0131r. Sa\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z
      bilgilerin do\u011Frulu\u011Fundan siz sorumluyusunuz.\\n4. \xD6d\xFCl \xD6demesi,
      Vergiler ve Transfer \xDCcretleri\\nT\xFCm uygun nakit \xF6d\xFCller, oyun
      taraf\u0131ndan belirlenen y\xF6ntemle \xF6denecektir. \xD6d\xFCl \xF6demesi,
      transfer hizmeti sa\u011Flay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n kullan\u0131m \u015Fartlar\u0131
      ve gizlilik politikas\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan d\xFCzenlenir. Uygulanabilir t\xFCm
      vergiler ve transfer \xFCcretlerinden siz sorumluyusunuz. Yasal gereklilikler
      gere\u011Fi, \xF6demenizden ilgili tutar\u0131 kesebiliriz.\\n5. \xD6d\xFCl
      De\u011Fi\u015Fimi Ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131\\nKazanan, belirlenen
      s\xFCre i\xE7inde \xE7ekme iste\u011Fi g\xF6ndermezse veya hesap silme vb.
      nedenlerle \xF6d\xFCl\xFC alamayorsa, bu \xF6d\xFCl\xFC iptal etme hakkimizi
      sakl\u0131 tutar\u0131z. \xD6d\xFCl\xFCn \xF6denmesi veya iptali hakk\u0131ndaki
      karar tamamen bizimdir.\\n6. Uygulanabilir \u015Eartlar ve \u0130hlal \u0130\u015Flemleri\\nBu
      politika bildirimi, oyunun Kullan\u0131m \u015Eartlar\u0131 ve Gizlilik politikas\u0131'n\u0131
      takip eder. Bu \u015Fartlar\u0131 ihlal ederseniz, \xF6d\xFCllerinin iptali
      veya hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n ask\u0131ya al\u0131nmas\u0131yla sonu\xE7lanabilir.\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"en-PH\",\r\n        \"Game Policy Statement\\n1.
      Account Requirements and Management\\nTo claim and manage rewards, you must
      have a valid account. If you are not yet registered, you can sign up for free
      on the official website. Note: if you delete the game from your device, your
      account balance will be reset to zero and any rewards without a valid withdrawal
      request submitted will be permanently canceled.\\n2. Reward Acquisition and
      Balance Check\\nWhen you earn coins in the game, rewards will be automatically
      added to your in-game balance. You can check your current balance at any time
      on the home page.\\n3. Withdrawal Process and Information Accuracy\\nWhen submitting
      a withdrawal request, provide your receiving account information and follow
      the instructions. Withdrawal requests are usually processed within 7 working
      days. After funds are transferred to the designated account, we cannot retransfer
      or recover the funds if the payment fails due to account information errors
      or user operation mistakes. You are responsible for ensuring the accuracy of
      the information provided.\\n4. Reward Payment, Taxes and Transfer Fees\\nAll
      eligible cash rewards will be paid through the method designated by the game.
      Reward payment is governed by the terms of service and privacy policy of the
      transfer service provider. You are responsible for all applicable taxes and
      transfer fees. If required by law, we may deduct the corresponding amount from
      your payment.\\n5. Failed Reward Redemption\\nIf the winner does not submit
      a withdrawal request within the specified period or cannot claim the reward
      due to account deletion or other reasons, we reserve the right to cancel the
      reward. The decision to pay or cancel the reward is solely ours.\\n6. Applicable
      Terms and Violation Handling\\nThis policy statement is subject to the game's
      Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. Violating these terms may result in the
      cancellation of rewards or suspension of your account.\"\r\n      ],\r\n     
      [\r\n        \"vi-VN\",\r\n        \"Th\xF4ng B\xE1o Ch\xEDnh S\xE1ch Tr\xF2
      Ch\u01A1i\\n1. Y\xEAu C\u1EA7u v\xE0 Qu\u1EA3n L\xFD T\xE0i Kho\u1EA3n\\n\u0110\u1EC3
      nh\u1EADn v\xE0 qu\u1EA3n l\xFD ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng, b\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i
      c\xF3 m\u1ED9t t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7. N\u1EBFu ch\u01B0a \u0111\u0103ng
      k\xFD, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u0103ng k\xFD mi\u1EC5n ph\xED tr\xEAn
      trang web ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c. L\u01B0u \xFD: n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n x\xF3a tr\xF2
      ch\u01A1i kh\u1ECFi thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB, s\u1ED1 d\u01B0 t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t l\u1EA1i v\u1EC1 kh\xF4ng
      v\xE0 m\u1ECDi ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng ch\u01B0a g\u1EEDi y\xEAu c\u1EA7u
      r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 s\u1EBD b\u1ECB h\u1EE7y v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n.\\n2.
      Nh\u1EADn Ph\u1EA7n Th\u01B0\u1EDFng v\xE0 Ki\u1EC3m Tra S\u1ED1 D\u01B0\\nKhi
      b\u1EA1n ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c xu trong tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i, ph\u1EA7n
      th\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xEAm
      v\xE0o s\u1ED1 d\u01B0 trong tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m
      tra s\u1ED1 d\u01B0 hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 l\xFAc n\xE0o tr\xEAn
      trang ch\u1EE7.\\n3. Quy Tr\xECnh R\xFAt Ti\u1EC1n v\xE0 \u0110\u1ED9 Ch\xEDnh
      X\xE1c C\u1EE7a Th\xF4ng Tin\\nKhi g\u1EEDi y\xEAu c\u1EA7u r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n,
      vui l\xF2ng cung c\u1EA5p th\xF4ng tin t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n nh\u1EADn ti\u1EC1n
      v\xE0 tu\xE2n theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn. Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\u1EED l\xFD trong 7 ng\xE0y l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c.
      Sau khi ti\u1EC1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EBFn t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n
      \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh, ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n
      l\u1EA1i ho\u1EB7c thu h\u1ED3i ti\u1EC1n n\u1EBFu thanh to\xE1n th\u1EA5t
      b\u1EA1i do l\u1ED7i th\xF4ng tin t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n ho\u1EB7c l\u1ED7i\u64CD\u4F5C
      c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng. B\u1EA1n ch\u1ECBu tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m \u0111\u1EA3m
      b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1ED9 ch\xEDnh x\xE1c c\u1EE7a th\xF4ng tin cung c\u1EA5p.\\n4.
      Thanh To\xE1n Ph\u1EA7n Th\u01B0\u1EDFng, Thu\u1EBF v\xE0 Ph\xED Chuy\u1EC3n
      Ti\u1EC1n\\nT\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng ti\u1EC1n m\u1EB7t
      \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thanh to\xE1n
      qua ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c do tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh.
      Thanh to\xE1n ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng tu\xE2n theo c\xE1c \u0111i\u1EC1u
      kho\u1EA3n s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng v\xE0 ch\xEDnh s\xE1ch b\u1EA3o m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a
      nh\xE0 cung c\u1EA5p d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 chuy\u1EC3n ti\u1EC1n. B\u1EA1n ch\u1ECBu
      tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EC1 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 thu\u1EBF \xE1p d\u1EE5ng v\xE0
      ph\xED chuy\u1EC3n ti\u1EC1n. N\u1EBFu ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt y\xEAu c\u1EA7u, ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tr\u1EEB s\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng t\u1EEB
      kho\u1EA3n thanh to\xE1n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.\\n5. Kh\xF4ng \u0110\u1ED5i \u0110\u1ED5i
      Ph\u1EA7n Th\u01B0\u1EDFng\\nN\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng
      kh\xF4ng g\u1EEDi y\xEAu c\u1EA7u r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n trong th\u1EDDi h\u1EA1n
