      VPN \u5417\uFF1F</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\u4E25\u7981\u4F7F\u7528 VPN\u3002\u8BF7\u5728\u4F7F\u7528\u672C\u5E94\u7528\u65F6
      <color=#B64A3A><b>\u4E0D\u8981\u4F7F\u7528 VPN</b></color>\u3002</color>\\n\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"en-US\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>How can
      I withdraw cash?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>There are cash rewards for each
      level you pass. The more levels you pass, the more rewards you get. You can
      withdraw cash once you meet the withdrawal requirements.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How
      long does it take to withdraw money?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Generally,
      funds will be credited to your account within a few minutes. If the number
      of withdrawals or the withdrawal amount exceeds a certain limit, the system
      will review it. In this case, the funds will still be credited within <color=#D98A6B><b>24
      hours</b></color>, so please don\u2019t worry.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Why
      did my withdrawal fail?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>If a withdrawal fails,
      the system will provide the reason in English. Please modify your information
      according to the prompt. If the withdrawal fails, the withdrawal amount will
      be returned automatically. You can update your information and initiate the
      withdrawal again. Please make sure all the information you provide is correct.
      We are <color=#B64A3A><b>not responsible</b></color> for withdrawal failures
      caused by incorrect information.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How many times
      can I withdraw?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Unlimited.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How
      many times can I withdraw per day?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Up to <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      times per day.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Why can\u2019t I withdraw funds
      using my withdrawal account?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>The same withdrawal
      account can be bound to a maximum of <color=#D98A6B><b>two</b></color> app
      accounts. Please do not share your withdrawal account with others.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Can
      I use a VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>The use of VPN is <color=#B64A3A><b>strictly
      prohibited</b></color>. Please do not use a VPN while using the app.</color>\\n\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"pt-BR\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>Como sacar
      dinheiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>H\xE1 recompensas em dinheiro para cada
      n\xEDvel conclu\xEDdo. Quanto mais n\xEDveis voc\xEA passar, maiores ser\xE3o
      as recompensas. Voc\xEA poder\xE1 sacar ap\xF3s atender aos requisitos.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Quanto
      tempo leva para sacar?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Normalmente, o valor \xE9
      creditado em poucos minutos. Caso o n\xFAmero de saques ou o valor ultrapasse
      o limite, o sistema far\xE1 uma revis\xE3o. Nesse caso, o valor ser\xE1 creditado
      em at\xE9 <color=#D98A6B><b>24 horas</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Por
      que meu saque falhou?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Se o saque falhar, o sistema
      informar\xE1 o motivo em ingl\xEAs. Corrija as informa\xE7\xF5es conforme solicitado.
      O valor ser\xE1 devolvido automaticamente. N\xE3o nos responsabilizamos por
      falhas causadas por informa\xE7\xF5es incorretas.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Quantas
      vezes posso sacar?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Ilimitado.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Quantas
      vezes posso sacar por dia?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>At\xE9 <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      vezes por dia.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Por que n\xE3o consigo sacar
      usando minha conta?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>A mesma conta de saque pode
      ser vinculada a no m\xE1ximo <color=#D98A6B><b>duas</b></color> contas do app.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Posso
      usar VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>O uso de VPN \xE9 <color=#B64A3A><b>estritamente
      proibido</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"id-ID\",\r\n       
      \"<color=#C26F50><b>Bagaimana cara menarik uang?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Ada
      hadiah uang untuk setiap level yang Anda selesaikan. Semakin banyak level,
      semakin besar hadiahnya. Penarikan tersedia setelah memenuhi syarat.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Berapa
      lama proses penarikan?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Biasanya dana masuk dalam
      beberapa menit. Jika jumlah atau nominal penarikan melebihi batas, sistem akan
      meninjau. Dana akan masuk dalam waktu <color=#D98A6B><b>24 jam</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Mengapa
      penarikan gagal?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Jika penarikan gagal, sistem
      akan menampilkan alasannya dalam bahasa Inggris. Perbarui informasi Anda. Dana
      akan dikembalikan otomatis. Kami tidak bertanggung jawab atas kesalahan informasi.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Berapa
      kali bisa menarik?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Tidak terbatas.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Berapa
      kali per hari?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Maksimal <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      kali per hari.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Mengapa akun penarikan tidak
      bisa digunakan?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Satu akun penarikan hanya dapat
      dihubungkan ke <color=#D98A6B><b>dua</b></color> akun aplikasi.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Bolehkah
      menggunakan VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Penggunaan VPN <color=#B64A3A><b>dilarang
      keras</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"ru-RU\",\r\n       
      \"<color=#C26F50><b>\u041A\u0430\u043A \u0432\u044B\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438
