      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"ko-KR\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>\uCD9C\uAE08\uC740
      \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD558\uB098\uC694?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uB808\uBCA8\uC744
      \uD074\uB9AC\uC5B4\uD560 \uB54C\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uD604\uAE08 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744
      \uBC1B\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB354 \uB9CE\uC740 \uB808\uBCA8\uC744
      \uC644\uB8CC\uD560\uC218\uB85D \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC774 \uC99D\uAC00\uD558\uBA70,
      \uC870\uAC74 \uCDA9\uC871 \uC2DC \uCD9C\uAE08\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\uCD9C\uAE08
      \uC18C\uC694 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC740?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
      \uBA87 \uBD84 \uB0B4\uC5D0 \uC9C0\uAE09\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uCD9C\uAE08 \uD69F\uC218
      \uB610\uB294 \uAE08\uC561\uC774 \uD55C\uB3C4\uB97C \uCD08\uACFC\uD558\uBA74
      \uC2EC\uC0AC\uAC00 \uC9C4\uD589\uB418\uBA70, <color=#D98A6B><b>24\uC2DC\uAC04</b></color>
      \uC774\uB0B4\uC5D0 \uC9C0\uAE09\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\uCD9C\uAE08
      \uC2E4\uD328 \uC774\uC720\uB294?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uC2E4\uD328
      \uC2DC \uC601\uC5B4\uB85C \uC0AC\uC720\uAC00 \uD45C\uC2DC\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uC815\uBCF4\uB97C \uC218\uC815 \uD6C4 \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2DC\uB3C4\uD558\uC138\uC694.
      \uAE08\uC561\uC740 \uC790\uB3D9 \uBC18\uD658\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC798\uBABB\uB41C
      \uC815\uBCF4\uB85C \uC778\uD55C \uC2E4\uD328\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uCC45\uC784\uC9C0\uC9C0
      \uC54A\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\uCD9C\uAE08 \uD69F\uC218
      \uC81C\uD55C\uC740?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uC81C\uD55C \uC5C6\uC74C.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\uD558\uB8E8
      \uCD9C\uAE08 \uD69F\uC218\uB294?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uD558\uB8E8
      \uCD5C\uB300 <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>\uD68C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\uCD9C\uAE08
      \uACC4\uC815\uC744 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD560 \uC218 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC774\uC720\uB294?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>\uD558\uB098\uC758
      \uCD9C\uAE08 \uACC4\uC815\uC740 \uCD5C\uB300 <color=#D98A6B><b>2</b></color>\uAC1C\uC758
      \uC571 \uACC4\uC815\uC5D0\uB9CC \uC5F0\uACB0\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>VPN
      \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uAC00\uB2A5?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>VPN \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC740
      <color=#B64A3A><b>\uC5C4\uACA9\uD788 \uAE08\uC9C0</b></color>\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.</color>\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"es-ES\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFC\xF3mo
      puedo retirar dinero?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Hay recompensas en efectivo
      por cada nivel completado. Cuantos m\xE1s niveles completes, m\xE1s recompensas
      obtendr\xE1s. Podr\xE1s retirar al cumplir los requisitos.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1nto
      tarda el retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Normalmente se acredita en pocos
      minutos. Si el monto o la frecuencia supera el l\xEDmite, el sistema revisar\xE1
      y el dinero llegar\xE1 en <color=#D98A6B><b>24 horas</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPor
      qu\xE9 fall\xF3 mi retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Si falla, el sistema
      mostrar\xE1 el motivo en ingl\xE9s. Corrige la informaci\xF3n. El dinero ser\xE1
      devuelto autom\xE1ticamente. No somos responsables por errores de datos.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1ntas
      veces puedo retirar?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Ilimitado.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1ntas
      veces al d\xEDa?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Hasta <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      veces por d\xEDa.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPor qu\xE9 no puedo usar
      mi cuenta de retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Una cuenta de retiro puede
      vincularse a un m\xE1ximo de <color=#D98A6B><b>dos</b></color> cuentas de la
      app.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPuedo usar VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>El
      uso de VPN est\xE1 <color=#B64A3A><b>estrictamente prohibido</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"es-MX\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFC\xF3mo
      puedo retirar dinero?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Obtienes recompensas en
      efectivo por cada nivel superado. Mientras m\xE1s niveles completes, mayores
      ser\xE1n las recompensas. Podr\xE1s retirar al cumplir los requisitos.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1nto
      tarda el retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Normalmente el dinero se acredita
      en minutos. Si el monto o frecuencia supera el l\xEDmite, se revisar\xE1 y
      llegar\xE1 en <color=#D98A6B><b>24 horas</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPor
      qu\xE9 fall\xF3 mi retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Si falla, el sistema
      mostrar\xE1 el motivo en ingl\xE9s. Corrige tus datos. El dinero se devolver\xE1
      autom\xE1ticamente. No somos responsables por informaci\xF3n incorrecta.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1ntas
      veces puedo retirar?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Ilimitado.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFCu\xE1ntas
      veces al d\xEDa?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Hasta <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      veces por d\xEDa.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPor qu\xE9 no puedo usar
      mi cuenta de retiro?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Una cuenta de retiro solo
      puede vincularse a <color=#D98A6B><b>dos</b></color> cuentas de la app.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>\xBFPuedo
      usar VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>El uso de VPN est\xE1 <color=#B64A3A><b>estrictamente
      prohibido</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"tr-TR\",\r\n       
      \"<color=#C26F50><b>Nas\u0131l para \xE7ekebilirim?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Her
      tamamlanan seviye i\xE7in nakit \xF6d\xFCl kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z. Daha
      fazla seviye, daha fazla \xF6d\xFCl demektir. Ko\u015Fullar sa\u011Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      \xE7ekim yap\u0131labilir.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Para \xE7ekme ne
      kadar s\xFCrer?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Genellikle birka\xE7 dakika i\xE7inde
      hesab\u0131n\u0131za ge\xE7er. Limit a\u015F\u0131l\u0131rsa inceleme yap\u0131l\u0131r
      ve para <color=#D98A6B><b>24 saat</b></color> i\xE7inde yat\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Neden
      \xE7ekim ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z oldu?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z
      olursa neden \u0130ngilizce g\xF6sterilir. Bilgileri d\xFCzeltin. Tutar otomatik
      iade edilir. Yanl\u0131\u015F bilgilerden sorumlu de\u011Filiz.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Ka\xE7
      kez \xE7ekim yapabilirim?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>S\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>G\xFCnde
      ka\xE7 kez?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>G\xFCnde en fazla <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      kez.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Neden \xE7ekim hesab\u0131m\u0131 kullanam\u0131yorum?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Bir
      \xE7ekim hesab\u0131 en fazla <color=#D98A6B><b>iki</b></color> uygulama hesab\u0131na
      ba\u011Flanabilir.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>VPN kullanabilir miyim?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>VPN
      kullan\u0131m\u0131 <color=#B64A3A><b>kesinlikle yasakt\u0131r</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n     
      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"en-PH\",\r\n        \"<color=#C26F50><b>How can
      I withdraw cash?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>You earn cash rewards for every
      level you complete. The more levels you finish, the more rewards you get. Withdrawal
      is available once requirements are met.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How
      long does withdrawal take?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Funds are usually credited
      within a few minutes. If limits are exceeded, review will apply and funds will
      arrive within <color=#D98A6B><b>24 hours</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Why
      did my withdrawal fail?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>If it fails, the reason
      will be shown in English. Please update your info. Funds will be refunded automatically.
      We are not responsible for incorrect details.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How
      many times can I withdraw?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Unlimited.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>How
      many times per day?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Up to <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      times per day.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Why can\u2019t I use my withdrawal
      account?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>One withdrawal account can only be linked
      to a maximum of <color=#D98A6B><b>two</b></color> app accounts.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>Can
      I use a VPN?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>VPN usage is <color=#B64A3A><b>strictly
      prohibited</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n      ],\r\n      [\r\n        \"vi-VN\",\r\n       
      \"<color=#C26F50><b>L\xE0m th\u1EBF n\xE0o \u0111\u1EC3 r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>B\u1EA1n
      nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng ti\u1EC1n m\u1EB7t
      khi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh m\u1ED7i m\xE0n ch\u01A1i. C\xE0ng ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC1u
      m\xE0n, ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\xFAt
      ti\u1EC1n khi \u0111\xE1p \u1EE9ng \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>R\xFAt
      ti\u1EC1n m\u1EA5t bao l\xE2u?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Th\xF4ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      ti\u1EC1n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n trong v\xE0i ph\xFAt. N\u1EBFu
      v\u01B0\u1EE3t gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n, h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD x\xE9t duy\u1EC7t
      v\xE0 ti\u1EC1n s\u1EBD v\u1EC1 trong v\xF2ng <color=#D98A6B><b>24 gi\u1EDD</b></color>.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>T\u1EA1i
      sao r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>N\u1EBFu
      th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i, h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB l\xFD do
      b\u1EB1ng ti\u1EBFng Anh. Vui l\xF2ng c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt th\xF4ng tin. Ti\u1EC1n
      s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n l\u1EA1i t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i kh\xF4ng ch\u1ECBu tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m do th\xF4ng tin sai.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>C\xF3
      th\u1EC3 r\xFAt bao nhi\xEAu l\u1EA7n?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Kh\xF4ng
      gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>M\u1ED7i ng\xE0y r\xFAt
      bao nhi\xEAu l\u1EA7n?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>T\u1ED1i \u0111a <color=#D98A6B><b>5</b></color>
      l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i ng\xE0y.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>T\u1EA1i sao kh\xF4ng
      th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>M\u1ED9t
      t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 li\xEAn k\u1EBFt
      t\u1ED1i \u0111a <color=#D98A6B><b>hai</b></color> t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng
      d\u1EE5ng.</color>\\n\\n<color=#C26F50><b>C\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng VPN kh\xF4ng?</b></color>\\n<color=#9E5A41>Vi\u1EC7c
      s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng VPN <color=#B64A3A><b>b\u1ECB nghi\xEAm c\u1EA5m</b></color>.</color>\"\r\n     
